.\" uncompress.1 -- maux's stub for the POSIX uncompress(1) utility,
.\" which this tree does not provide. An original page (this
.\" project's own text), so it carries no third-party notice -- MIT
.\" like the code, same posture as env.1/man.1. Recorded in
.\" docs/POSIX-GAPS.md sec 5 ("Not applicable, and why") so the
.\" omission is not re-litigated. Rendered at build time to
.\" build/man/UNCOMPRESS.TXT and staged on the play image as
.\" /usr/man/UNCOMPRESS.
.TH UNCOMPRESS 1 "September 17, 2026" maux
.SH NAME
uncompress \- expand compressed data
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Uncompress
is not provided on maux.
LZW compression is possible on a 1 MHz 6502 (ShrinkIt did it)
but nothing on this machine needs it yet.
